      "statement": "Graph construction builds a core stack of filesystem, optional synchronous subagents, parent notification, summarization, tool-call repair, and optional asynchronous subagents; profile middleware, optional skills, provider caching, optional memory, HITL, and unsupported-content filtering form the tail. Caller middleware replaces a same-named entry in place or otherwise lands after the core, and profile-controlled tool exclusion is appended last.",
